What:           /sys/fs/btrfs/<uuid>/qgroups/shared_parent_quick_inherit
Date:           2026-10-20
Contact:        linux-btrfs@vger.kernel.org
Description:
                Controls the shared-parent snapshot quick-inherit optimization
                for this filesystem. The value is a boolean and defaults to
                1. When set to 0, eligible shared-parent snapshot inheritance
                uses the conservative rescan fallback, matching stock
                behavior without this optimization.

                Changing the value only affects future snapshot inheritance.
                It does not repair or rescan qgroup accounting already marked
                inconsistent. For comparisons, set the value before starting
                each workload and use equivalent filesystem state.
